              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Janny2123"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is delicious! I'm craving it right now in fact. I added mozzarella cheese and some chicken. It had just the right amount of blue cheese that the recipe called for. I loaded it with asparagus, but to make slicing the pizza easier, place the asparagus straight towards the center and slice between them. Otherwise, it gets messy!",
