            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "sugarhigh"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was very easy to make and surprisingly good. I wasn't sure how the flavors would mesh on a pizza, but my husband loved it. I did add crumbled turkey bacon for a little extra flavor.",
            "datePublished": "2010-11-20T17:22:46.870Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "pinkypink"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Absolutely delicious!!! I can't believe how easy it was. A pre-made pizza kit, fresh asparagus and a small package of blue cheese makes for an extremely easy but very gourmet meal. Fresh asparagus is in season right now, and it complimented the blue cheese nicely. It was also delicious with my merlot. I will make again, but I do recommend making this one when asparagus is in season, because the taste of new asparagus is out of this world.",
            "datePublished": "2010-06-12T16:36:21.253Z"
          }
